   $q$What was Augusta Fenwick's position in the debate?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Millbrook should close its Main Street shops earlier at night.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Millbrook should replace its gas lamps with electric streetlights.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Millbrook should keep its gas lamps and reject electric lights.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-speakers"},{"text":"Millbrook should hire the Dalton company to light its streets.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Millbrook should replace its gas lamps with electric streetlights.$q$, $q$The passage says Fenwick "spoke in favor of the lights." Keeping the gas lamps was Moreau's position, not hers.$q$, 'draft', '1320f481-cf9c-5b60-9035-011cd5957c22')
