   $q$Which concern about the repair elective does the author leave unanswered?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Whether the tools would be too expensive to buy.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overlooks-evidence"},{"text":"Whether the class would fit into the schedule.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overlooks-evidence"},{"text":"Who would be qualified to teach the class.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Whether a repair program has worked at another school.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overlooks-evidence"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Who would be qualified to teach the class.$q$, $q$The passage addresses tool costs, the schedule and Lakeview's results, but it never says who would teach students to make repairs. The tool cost concern is answered with the comparison to fixing four laptops.$q$, 'draft', '815f9064-82a4-59f7-849f-883751b4ae79')
