   $q$What is the author's central claim?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Paid scientists should replace volunteers in winter bird counts.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Volunteer bird counts are a valuable source of scientific data.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Birdwatching is the most relaxing weekend hobby a person can have.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Volunteers misidentify birds too often for their counts to matter.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-counterclaim"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Volunteer bird counts are a valuable source of scientific data.$q$, $q$The first paragraph states that "volunteer bird counts are a valuable source of scientific data." The point about misidentified birds is a criticism the author answers, not the author's claim.$q$, 'draft', 'ecc248a0-2807-54eb-b802-b752f8eaa63d')
