   $q$What is the author's main claim?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Fairmont Middle School should sell more bottled water in its cafeteria.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Fairmont Middle School should build new sports fields for its teams.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"},{"text":"Fairmont Middle School should install water refill stations in its hallways.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Fairmont Middle School should add more recycling bins to its cafeteria.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Fairmont Middle School should install water refill stations in its hallways.$q$, $q$The first paragraph says the school "should install water refill stations in its hallways." The recycling bins are mentioned only to explain why bottles end up in the trash.$q$, 'draft', 'e115c2cd-33a0-53ef-9e9f-311ac1f59a06')
